                    Soviet NSSD (3 of 3) [NSSD 11–82]. Secret. Sent for action. Copied to
                        Stearman.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d207-f2" n="2" xml:id="d207-f2-content">
                <p>An unknown hand underlined “introduction, a section detailing the objectives of
                    the directive.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d207-f3" n="3" xml:id="d207-f3-content">
                <p>
                    Clark checked his approval of the
                    recommendation.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
